<h2>Segment 200 &mdash; the environment from lying</h2>
<div class="pair">
<div class="tib"><div class="lab">TIBETAN (WYLIE)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s200S"><span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s200w1">brdzun du smra ba</span>&#x27;i ni, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s200w2">zhing las</span> dang gru spyod pa&#x27;i las kyi mtha&#x27; <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s200p1">rgyas par mi &#x27;gyur ba</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s200p2">mthun par mi &#x27;gyur</span> zhing <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s200w3">phal cher</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s200w4">bslu ba</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s200w5">&#x27;jigs pa</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s200p3">&#x27;jigs su rung ba&#x27;i rgyu</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s200w6">mang po</span> dang ldan pa dang</span>
